OOD improvements exceed the in-distribution gain, providing no evidence of distribution matching.
At $\tau{=}0.8$, OOD improvements are smaller ($\Delta{=}{-}0.005$ OWT, $\Delta{=}{-}0.004$ Wiki; \S\ref{sec:sensitivity}).

